[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 17820.23, "timestamp": "04:57:00", "text": "你见过有人为自己感到难过吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17842.07, "timestamp": "04:57:22", "text": "在骗局中。好吧，行。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17844.31, "timestamp": "04:57:24", "text": "参赛者可参加比赛"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17846.628, "timestamp": "04:57:26", "text": "在。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17848.948, "timestamp": "04:57:28", "text": "呃，参加比赛就是为了这件事"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17853.03, "timestamp": "04:57:33", "text": "因为PayPal不允许本地交易。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17858.708, "timestamp": "04:57:38", "text": "像我们这样的印度用户的交易"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17861.99, "timestamp": "04:57:41", "text": "我想做UPI，但问题是如果我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17866.788, "timestamp": "04:57:46", "text": "如果使用 UPI，我的真实姓名会被曝光。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17868.39, "timestamp": "04:57:48", "text": "所以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17873.51, "timestamp": "04:57:53", "text": "我当时在看 Razer Pay 之类的东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17876.788, "timestamp": "04:57:56", "text": "我报名参加了，一切都很顺利。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17878.23, "timestamp": "04:57:58", "text": "因为它是免费的，所以就那样吧。"}]